# Doom (a game with native controller support): the controller goes through to the game untouched.
setup packs/doom-and-doom-2.padpack
tap south 40
tap lb 40
stick left 1 0
trigger right 0.5
stick left 0 0
trigger right 0
---
pad South down             @0
pad South up               @40
pad LeftBumper down        @40
pad LeftBumper up          @80
pad-axis LeftX 1.00        @80
pad-axis RightTrigger 0.50 @80
pad-axis LeftX 0.00        @80
pad-axis RightTrigger 0.00 @80
